==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Use any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win. You may also want to add a critical hitter for the Metal Hippoe, but it's ultimately unnecessary due to its very low attack power and HP.

